---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout title="About Me">
  <section class="author" style="margin-bottom:36px">
    <img src={`${base}profile.jpg`} alt="Portrait of Jeyapandi Sethu Krishnan" width="100" height="100" />
    <div><h1 style="font-size:2.1rem;margin-bottom:6px">About Me</h1><p>Hi, I'm Jeyapandi.</p></div>
  </section>
  <p>I'm a technology and consulting professional with over 20+ years of experience in consulting, enterprise applications, digital transformation. My work has focused on helping organizations solve complex business challenges through technology, particularly in Oracle Cloud ERP and financial transformation.</p>
  <p>Throughout my career, I've had the opportunity to work on large-scale technology transformations, lead teams, and mentor professionals. One thing that has always interested me is understanding how technology works and how it can create meaningful value.</p>
  <p>Today, one area that particularly interests me is Agentic AI — the technology that enables AI systems to reason through tasks, interact with tools, and execute multi-step workflows.</p>
  <h2>Why AI Agents Explained?</h2>
  <p>AI is evolving at an incredible pace. We are seeing AI systems move beyond answering questions to using tools, making decisions, and executing complex workflows.</p>
  <p>I find this shift fascinating.</p>
  <p>As I explore AI Agent technologies, I want to share what I learn, experiment with different approaches, and make these concepts easier for others to understand.</p>
  <p>That's why I created <strong>AI Agents Explained</strong>.</p>
  <p>A place to explore AI Agent architecture, emerging technologies, frameworks, and real-world applications through simple explanations and practical examples.</p>
  <h2>What You'll Find Here</h2>
  <p>I'll be sharing my perspectives on AI Agent technologies, breaking down technical concepts, and exploring how they work through hands-on examples.</p>
  <p>My focus is on connecting the technology with practical applications, while keeping the explanations clear and accessible.</p>
  <p><strong>Welcome to AI Agents Explained.</strong></p>
</BaseLayout>
